Setup checklist  what a run needs, as `aja doctor` checks it

> ✓ config          ~/config.yaml
  ✓ chrome          Chromium 152 (/usr/bin/chromium)
  ✓ chrome profile  ~/chrome-profile (the aja profile), signed in to LinkedIn
  ✓ ai              off (ai.enabled: false)
  ✓ telegram        off (set AJA_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN and AJA_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID to turn on)
  ✓ resume          ~/resumes/cv.pdf
  ✓ data dir        ~

config: ~/config.yaml

Import from the Python bot  its settings, answer memory, job history and resume
